  "stats are floor-1 values; hp x hp_mult and damage x dmg_mult per floor (runloop.json floors); the boss uses absolute values",
  "telegraph language: every attack wind-up shows an amber glint on the striking part (+ a body shiver); ambush and lob attacks also mark the floor with an amber ring",
